title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf log contexts
catalog: CLI command
target: mf log contexts
summary: List the log contexts with their counts and what undid them, newest first, reading no operation

!! Reference

```
List the log contexts with their counts and what undid them, newest first, reading no operation

Usage: mf log contexts [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --in <PARENT>
          Only the log contexts nested in this one (default: the units of work)

      --limit <LIMIT>
          Show at most N log contexts; default 20

      --all
          Remove the default limit of 20

  -h, --help
          Print help
```
